WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.102
Tonight, 1.1 billion.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:02.402
That's

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.370
how many people in China

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.771
have been infected with COVID

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.172
in less than two months.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:06.906
Now, officials claim

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.808
that 60,000 people have died

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.076
since the restrictions were lifted.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.277
But independent estimates say

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.446
that that number is closer to a million

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.015
dead people from COVID.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.750
President Xi Jinping admitting China's

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.451
surge has been fierce,

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.319
but retaliation

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.720
against those who dare speak out

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.521
against his COVID

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.523
policies remains in full force.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.325
Selina Wang with a chilling report

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.993
about one of the protesters

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.361
who is missing tonight.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.697
It's a report you'll see first OUTFRONT

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.366
---

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.801
If you're seeing this video,

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.302
that means I've already been taken

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.104
by the police. So, Sam, what is it?

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:38.738
Has it where?

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.373
These are the chilling words

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.175
of a young woman in China

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.877
who took part in this demonstration

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.046
in Beijing on November 27th.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.280
It was one of dozens

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.215
of anti-Soviet protests

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.251
that erupted in cities across China.

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.185
They're chanting that

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:54.421
they don't want COVID test.

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.789
They want freedom.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.190
Police lined the streets,

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.459
but the mood was calm and peaceful.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.593
Many were there to mourn

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.829
the lives lost in China's Urumqi city.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.364
Where a deadly fire

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.800
broke out in a lockdown building.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.001
This 26 year old

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:10.270
woman and editor at a publishing house.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.605
So that is why she and her friends

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.840
took to the streets.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.542
She said they followed the rules

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.243
and didn't have any conflict

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.244
with the police.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.046
Soon after filming this,

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.481
she was arrested.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.550
She knew her time was nearing.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.151
CNN has learned from sources

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.053
that weeks after the protest,

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:28.988
police started rounding up her friends

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.557
one by one.

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.459
Most of them also young

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:34.094
female professionals.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.528
We tracked down and interviewed

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.396
one of her friends

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.630
who's been tirelessly

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.698
searching for her

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.133
for not revealing her name

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.102
or any of the sources we've spoken to.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.370
Because of concerns of retribution from

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.706
the Chinese state. So now

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:48.641
authorities want to

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.844
intimidate ordinary people, she said.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.445
They want to turn people

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:54.647
into emotionless machines.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.383
We can't even gather together to grieve.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.018
Police swiftly

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.653
cracked down on the protesters

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.688
in some cities

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:02.822
violently pushing

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:04.691
and dragging the demonstrators.

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:06.159
But the Beijing protesters

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.594
peacefully dispersed.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.429
Afterwards, police blanketed

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.563
protest sites

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.598
in some places

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:12.398
authorities check

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.501
cell phones for virtual private networks

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.602
and tracked down

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.771
participants with cell phone data.

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:19.906
Soon after, China

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.040
dropped it, zero COVID

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.575
policy and opened up.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.676
We'll talk again with you.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.111
In his New Year's Eve address,

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:26.045
Chinese leader Xi

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:28.414
Jinping said it was, quote, only natural

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:29.315
for different people

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.750
to have different concerns

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.951
or hold different views

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:33.186
on the same issue.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.420
But behind the scenes,

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.088
their loved ones

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.290
say the retribution continues.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.359
Well, to help

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:42.128
her draw, she's paying a heavy price.

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.997
We were born into this land,

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.165
so naturally we would

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.399
want to make China better.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:48.535
But now I

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:50.904
feel there's nothing that we can do

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.506
she says, breaking down into tears.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.042
Authorities have made no official comment

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.377
about the detentions

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:58.945
and will likely never know

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:00.547
how many people have been detained

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.182
in connection with the protests.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:04.517
If it's dozens, hundreds or more,

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:05.985
as people

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:06.819
across China

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.521
are celebrating the Lunar New Year

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.290
with their newfound freedom,

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.625
the young woman says the mothers of her

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:13.793
and her friends

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:15.295
want to know why their daughters

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:16.863
were taken from them.

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.165
In her final words in the video message

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:21.201
she made, this call for help.

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.336
Don't let us be taken away

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:25.572
or convicted arbitrarily.

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:26.839
Don't let us disappear

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.442
from this world unjustly.

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.343
That's all

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:32.478
And Aaron, we've learned

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:33.580
that the young woman you saw

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.881
there is one of eight friends

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.182
who've been quietly detained

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.116
after the protest.

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:38.851
We've reached out to Beijing authorities

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.119
multiple times for comment

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.221
on the detentions.

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.722
They have not responded.

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.623
Now, the people who know

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:44.891
these young women told us

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:46.426
that they're confused as to why

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:47.060
they were taken,

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:47.760
describing them

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.461
as young women

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.429
working in publishing

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:50.463
journalism, saying

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:51.531
they're socially minded,

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.433
but they are not organizers.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.067
Experts say

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:54.867
the police may have been

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:55.935
suspicious of young,

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:57.370
politically aware women.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.137
Authorities here

00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.739
also have a well documented

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.441
history of targeting feminists.

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.508
At least one of the women

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.244
detained said she was interrogated

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.912
about whether she was involved

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:08.014
in feminist groups Erin.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:09.582
Incredible. Salena, thank you.

